I found 9 candidate defects in `wave1-base...HEAD`. As the brief asked, I only removed duplicates and did not verify any of them. Nothing calls the new `props_type` module yet: `relevance/mod.rs` turns off the dead-code check until slice T7. So for now these defects can only affect tests and later wiring, not output. I did not run builds or tests.

