    "summary": "`is_literal_union` only recognises `PropType::Union` of plain literals. It misses `PropType::LiteralUnion` (CVA variants, `(typeof X)[number]` const arrays) and enum-member unions (`PropType::EnumMember`).",
    "failure_scenario": "A cva `variant` prop resolves to `PropType::LiteralUnion { members: [...] }`, and a prop typed `Size` (an enum) resolves to `Union([EnumMember..])`. Both get `literal_union=false`, so `decide` orders these variant-like rows after plain ones, against ADR 0028's ordering."
  },
